  "citation": "Boye K; Crystal-Ornelas R; O'Ryan D; Goldman A E; Damerow J; Varadharajan C; Agarwal D (2022): ESS-DIVE Reporting Format for Sample-based Water and Soil Chemistry Measurements. Environmental Systems Science Data Infrastructure for a Virtual Ecosystem (ESS-DIVE). Dataset. doi:10.15485/1865731",
